{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "复合函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$3$", "explanation": "由链式法则，\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{dy/dt}{dx/dt}=\\frac{3e^{3t}f'(e^{3t}-1)}{f'(t)}.\n$$\n\n令 $t=0$，得\n\n$$\n\\left.\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right|_{t=0}=\\frac{3f'(0)}{f'(0)}=3.\n$$", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}+\\sqrt{3}$", "explanation": "有 $y'=1-2\\sin x$。令 $y'=0$ 得区间内唯一驻点 $x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}$。比较端点和驻点函数值：$y(0)=2$，$y(\\pi/2)=\\pi/2$，$y(\\pi/6)=\\pi/6+\\sqrt{3}$，故最大值为 $\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}+\\sqrt{3}$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限", "等价无穷小"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$0$", "explanation": "分子满足 $1-\\sqrt{1-x^2}\\sim \\dfrac{x^2}{2}$。分母有 $e^x-\\cos x\\sim x$，故原式相当于 $\\dfrac{x^2/2}{x}\\to0$。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["广义积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln2$", "explanation": "拆分为\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x(x^2+1)}=\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{x}{x^2+1}.\n$$\n\n于是原积分为\n\n$$\n\\left[\\ln x-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(x^2+1)\\right]_1^{+\\infty}=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln2.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{e}$", "explanation": "联立 $xe^x=ex$ 得交点 $x=0,1$。在 $[0,1]$ 上直线在上，面积为\n\n$$\nS=\\int_0^1(ex-xe^x)dx=e\\!\\int_0^1x\\,dx-\\int_0^1xe^x dx=\\frac{1}{e}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["无穷小比较", "等价无穷小", "泰勒展开"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由泰勒展开 $\\sin x=x-\\dfrac{x^3}{6}+o(x^3)$，故\n\n$$\nx-\\sin x\\sim\\frac{x^3}{6}=o(x^2).\n$$\n\n所以它是 $x^2$ 的高阶无穷小。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["复合函数", "分段函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "当 $x<0$ 时，$-x>0$，所以 $f(-x)=(-x)^2+(-x)=x^2-x$；当 $x\\ge0$ 时，$-x\\le0$，所以 $f(-x)=(-x)^2=x^2$。故选 D。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "化简为 $(x+1)e^{1/(x-1)}$。当 $x\\to1^-$ 时指数趋于 $-\\infty$，极限为 $0$；当 $x\\to1^+$ 时指数趋于 $+\\infty$，极限为 $+\\infty$。左右极限不同，所以极限不存在，且不属于“趋于无穷大”。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["变上限积分", "求导"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "直接用牛顿-莱布尼茨公式和链式法则：\n\n$$\nF'(x)=f\\bigl((x^2)^2\\bigr)\\cdot (x^2)'=2xf(x^4).\n$$", "methods": ["链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "single_choice", "score": 3, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["原函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_001.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由 $f'(x)=\\sin x$ 可知 $f(x)=-\\cos x+C$。因此 $f(x)$ 的一个原函数可以取\n\n$$\nF(x)=\\int(-\\cos x+1)dx=1-\\sin x,\n$$\n\n故选 B。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["重要极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$e^{-3/2}$", "explanation": "把底数写成\n\n$$\n1-\\frac{3}{x+6}.\n$$\n\n于是原式为标准极限型：\n\n$$\n\\left(1-\\frac{3}{x+6}\\right)^{\\frac{x+6}{2}\\cdot\\frac{x-1}{x+6}}\\to e^{-3/2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$2e^2$", "explanation": "由原方程得 $y(0)=1$。先求一阶导：\n\n$$\ny'-e^y-xe^y y'=0\\Rightarrow y'=\\frac{e^y}{1-xe^y}.\n$$\n\n故 $y'(0)=e$。再对上式或原方程再次求导并在 $(0,1)$ 处代入，可得 $y''(0)=2e^2$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["不定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{1}{3}(1+x^2)^{3/2}-\\sqrt{1+x^2}+C$", "explanation": "写成\n\n$$\n\\frac{x^3}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}=x\\sqrt{1+x^2}-\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1+x^2}}.\n$$\n\n两项分别令 $u=1+x^2$ 即可，积分后得到\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}(1+x^2)^{3/2}-\\sqrt{1+x^2}+C.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分", "三角恒等变形"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$4(\\sqrt{2}-1)$", "explanation": "利用\n\n$$\n1-\\sin x=\\left(\\sin\\frac{x}{2}-\\cos\\frac{x}{2}\\right)^2,\n$$\n\n故被积函数为绝对值 $\\left|\\sin\\dfrac{x}{2}-\\cos\\dfrac{x}{2}\\right|$。在 $x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$ 处分段积分，得到\n\n$$\n\\int_0^\\pi\\sqrt{1-\\sin x}dx=4(\\sqrt{2}-1).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 5, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$y=C\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{5}x^3$", "explanation": "化为线性方程\n\n$$\ny'-\\frac{1}{2x}y=-\\frac{x^2}{2}.\n$$\n\n积分因子为 $x^{-1/2}$，故\n\n$$\n(x^{-1/2}y)'=-\\frac{1}{2}x^{3/2}.\n$$\n\n积分得 $y=C\\sqrt{x}-\\dfrac{1}{5}x^3$。", "methods": ["积分因子"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["分段函数", "定积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\dfrac{7}{3}-\\dfrac{1}{e}$", "explanation": "令 $t=x-2$，则积分区间化为 $[-1,1]$。于是\n\n$$\n\\int_1^3f(x-2)dx=\\int_{-1}^0(1+t^2)dt+\\int_0^1e^{-t}dt=\\frac{4}{3}+1-\\frac{1}{e}=\\frac{7}{3}-\\frac{1}{e}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$y=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}-\\left(\\dfrac{x^2}{2}+x\\right)e^x$", "explanation": "对应齐次方程特征根为 $1,2$，所以齐次通解为 $C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}$。设特解为 $y_p=e^x x(ax+b)$，代入原方程可得 $a=-\\dfrac{1}{2},b=-1$。故通解为\n\n$$\ny=C_1e^x+C_2e^{2x}-\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}+x\\right)e^x.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["弧长"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$\\ln3-\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "先求导：\n\n$$\ny'=-\\frac{2x}{1-x^2}.\n$$\n\n于是\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{1+(y')^2}=\\frac{1+x^2}{1-x^2}=-1+\\frac{2}{1-x^2}.\n$$\n\n故弧长为\n\n$$\n\\int_0^{1/2}\\frac{1+x^2}{1-x^2}dx=\\left[-x+\\ln\\frac{1+x}{1-x}\\right]_0^{1/2}=\\ln3-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["切线", "最值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "$l: y=\\dfrac{x}{2}+\\dfrac{1}{2}$", "explanation": "设切点横坐标为 $t>0$，则切线方程为\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{x}{2\\sqrt{t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{t}}{2}.\n$$\n\n把曲线与切线在 $[0,2]$ 上围成面积记为 $S(t)$，积分化简后可得 $S'(t)=0$ 的唯一解为 $t=1$，且该点给出最小值。因此所求切线为\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_1992", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 1992, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "proof", "score": 9, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["拉格朗日中值定理", "不等式证明"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_1992_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_1992_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page_002.png"], "answer": "见解析。", "explanation": "由于 $f''(x)<0$，所以 $f'(x)$ 严格递减。由拉格朗日中值定理，存在 $\\xi\\in(0,x_1)$、$\\eta\\in(x_2,x_1+x_2)$ 使\n\n$$\nf(x_1)-f(0)=f'(\\xi)x_1,\\qquad f(x_1+x_2)-f(x_2)=f'(\\eta)x_1.\n$$\n\n又因 $\\xi<\\eta$，故 $f'(\\xi)>f'(\\eta)$，从而\n\n$$\nf(x_1)>f(x_1+x_2)-f(x_2),\n$$\n\n即 $f(x_1+x_2)<f(x_1)+f(x_2)$。", "methods": []}
